{
  "name": "Modules",
  "step": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "text": "call goal Page module=%!app.module.file%",
      "line": {
        "number": 9
      },
      "comment": "The learner pages, each module's start.md in its own os folder (Ingi; a new /system/… file lands where its folder\nis, the app's own /system/ first, else the os's: decision 522), each written from the module catalog, never by hand (decision 411; the spec is\nDocumentation/v0.2/module-reference-generation.md): the module's description, then each action's description,\nthe steps of its examples, its properties (how a step says each, its type, whether it is required, its default,\nwhat it changes) and what it returns.\nOnly the file, condition and loop modules' notes are tagged (with a golden page each), so only their pages are\nwritten. The loop over %!app.module.list% comes when every module's notes are tagged.",
      "code": [
        {
          "module": "goal",
          "name": "call",
          "property": [
            {
              "name": "Name",
              "type": {
                "name": "goal"
              },
              "value": "Page"
            },
            {
              "name": "Parameter",
              "type": {
                "name": "list"
              },
              "value": [{"name":"module","type":{"name":"item","template":"plang"},"value":"%!app.module.file%","variable":[{"text":"%!app.module.file%","code":[{"variable":"!app"},{"property":"module"},{"property":"file"}]}]}]
            }
          ],
          "default": [
            {
              "name": "parallel",
              "type": {
                "name": "bool"
              },
              "value": false
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
